<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-18T11:28:01.054Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:28:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran has installed a new defence minister and is intensifying IRGC drone and artillery attacks in Iraqi Kurdistan while launching missiles near the UAE and bombarding a tug in the Strait of Hormuz, widening its maritime campaign. An explosion hit an Iranian-backed group in Iraq and Iran urged the US to accept a proposal to reopen the strait. A powerful African military is weighing joining Saudi Arabia, Pakistan and Turkey in defending Saudi interests against Houthi attacks, and the US ambassador to Israel condemned a settler attack on a US journalist in the West Bank. 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/14/business/economy/gas-prices-inflation-cpi.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOUllscVFHdi1ER1I5djNzUWkwbXpXUGVTRkRVLUNWSWRBUU9lek5waWFCVjJwMXphLXFHaV9EUkF0SjdXVGMwNnpLYl9xZ2xrWDFvZzlrN2RwV2J4QUt1UUtiLTlzZTA1Qms2eTMtTjMyRXRGblJXVkF5NV9nTzEzTE1rbDFLUDdNOWRuQlhrS1BIVXFRdVJiQUtuT0lmODVRcVZ1dTRMeU11SkJuWlJvNGNJUjJhY1RBVGN1WWJGQ0JyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFA2Z0p0Z3N1bmMzbjdTRG1rSWNId205WC1ZY2hKUGprQVBPNWpiay1PazV1TkpDY0hhZWlZbEU1SFN1UlVEVEt3bGFod0dwQ3l1Mkw0YWczZjk3dFVs?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOY0R3SVhHQXhpdVMtdDFFMDdfX21wWlBqWEdkUmowdGVrbUlNbXd2ZFFyS2JYbkpHRnlVWl96eGM3dXZ3VVJuZ0ZNTmxNQ2ExTDhwNWtadnQwdXhiRmpqcnZETmdCdmJHVUFHblR2U2Z4NEw1MUxiM3hNX1ZnSktGTWwzRjVrYmNoNUVMTU8xTG94OU00OWs0ZUxFdWhsTXZRR3V5UA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kath